⍝ Blake McBride's Bugs38 severity A items (#1 - #15): crashes, hangs,
⍝ assertions, and session loss.






      ⍝ Bugs38 #1: ⎕FIO[57] checks B before fork(): an error must not continue
      ⍝ in the forked child as a second interpreter





      H←⎕FIO[57] '/bin/true',(⎕UCS 0),'x'
DOMAIN ERROR+
      H←⎕FIO[57]'/bin/true',(⎕UCS 0),'x'
        ^


      )MORE
⎕FIO: path contains a NUL character (⎕UCS 0)




