      ⍝ Bugs38 #5, #6: a ⎕WA margin that leaves too little memory for the next
      ⍝ statements is rejected, also INT64_MAX (used to overflow the check)





      ⎕SYL[32;2]←9223372036854775807
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕SYL[32;2]←9223372036854775807
      ^         ^


      )MORE
⎕WA safety margin 9223372036854775807 in ⎕SYL[32;2] is too large (it leaves no free workspace memory)




      ⎕SYL[32;2]←9223372036854000000
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕SYL[32;2]←9223372036854000000
      ^         ^


